Package: IsoFishR
Title: Data Reduction and Analysis of Laser-Ablation Strontium Isotope Profiles
Version: 1.99.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Malte", "Willmes", , "malte.willmes@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Katherine", "Ransom", role = "aut"),
    person("James", "Hobbs", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Reduces 87Sr/86Sr isotope ratios measured by laser-ablation
    multi-collector ICP-MS (blank correction, Rb interference and mass bias
    correction, outlier rejection, smoothing) and supports profile analysis
    (trimming, regions, changepoints). Version 2 development; the original
    application is preserved under the v1.1 tag.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/MalteWillmes/IsoFishR
BugReports: https://github.com/MalteWillmes/IsoFishR/issues
